 ### [Photometric Loss](11090-photometric-loss.md)
-Combines $\ell_1$ reconstruction with D-SSIM for perceptual structure.
+Minimizes the difference between rendered pixels and input training images during joint optimization. It distinguishes itself by combining an $\ell_1$ reconstruction term with a differentiable Structural Similarity (D-SSIM) term to balance pixel-wise accuracy and perceptual structure. Choose it when perceptual quality and structural fidelity are prioritized over strict pixel-wise alignment.
 
